# Rust / Tauri
/target
/src-tauri/target
/src-tauri/gen/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this is an application workspace.

# Node / Vite (once scaffolded)
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local

# Lore local data (NEVER commit — may contain sensitive indexed content)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
/blobs/
/exports/
/logs/

# Fixtures: commit ONLY anonymized fixtures under src-tauri/fixtures/.
# Never commit raw agent sessions or real ~/.claude / ~/.codex data.
/scratch/
*.real.jsonl

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# Env / secrets (signing, notarization) — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.provisionprofile

# Project documentation is local-only and must not be published.
# README.md is the sole exception — it is the repo's public front page.
*.md
!README.md
/docs/

# Local agent instructions and design previews
/.claude/
/preview.html
/src/preview.tsx
